      "image": "assets/images/18237/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat oil in a deep fryer to 375 degrees F (190 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine flour, salt, and pepper in a shallow bowl. Place eggs in another bowl. Place bread crumbs in a third bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/RO2uOIgHhFGJygQEyPhemIgzbmE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/RM-18237-DeepFriedOysters-ddmfs-Step2-3x4-7144-5478a380217144a1ba0e5a7489f234a6.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/18237/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Dredge oysters in flour mixture, then dip in egg and roll in bread crumbs to coat thoroughly.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/c8fWJNxCtF3LCYKY42P9qd6eQ4w=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/RM-18237-DeepFriedOysters-ddmfs-Step3-3x4-7149-e3271584b13e4042b93aabfac8f6e708.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/18237/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook oysters, 5 at a time, in hot oil until golden brown, about 2 minutes. Drain on a paper towel-lined plate. Serve hot.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
